---
import triad from "../data/triad.json";
const after = triad.after.rule;
---

<section data-spotlight class="spotlight relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap stage stage-center">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Agent Reliability Lab · Tool-Using Agent 可靠性与评测工程</p>
    <h1 class="reveal measure mt-7 display">
      把 agent 做成<br />
      <span class="gradient-text">可测、可审、可回归。</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl lead">
      Governed Runtime, Evaluation Harness, and Decision Frontier for Tool-Using Agents.
      <span class="text-ink">公开结论由可验签的 claim registry 限定证据范围。</span>
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-16 flex items-end justify-center gap-12 sm:gap-20">
      <div>
        <div class="num text-6xl font-extrabold text-brand sm:text-8xl"><span data-count="0">0</span></div>
        <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">越权 / 无证据执行<br /><span class="num text-faint">F13 = F11 = 0</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="h-16 w-px bg-line sm:h-24"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="num text-6xl font-extrabold sm:text-8xl"><span data-count={after.unauthorized_action_blocked.toFixed(2)}>1.00</span></div>
        <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">越权动作拦截率<br /><span class="num text-faint">真实留出 run</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="#live" class="reveal scroll-cue">
      看 agent 跑一遍
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" /></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
